// Manifest Heritage

// Summon Dracolisk
@1 = ~Summon Dracolisk~
@2 = ~Summon Dracolisk
(Conjuration)

Level: 5
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

The Black Dragon Disciple calls forth the spirit of a dracolisk, the offspring of a black dragon and a basilisk, which fights at his side until the spell ends. Only one dracolisk can answer the call at a time: the spell cannot be cast again until the current one runs out.

Dracolisk: 60 hit points, Armor Class 2, THAC0 11, 2 attacks per round (bite: 2d6+2, +2 weapon); immune to acid, fear and poison.
Stunning Gaze: every 3 rounds at most, the dracolisk stares at an enemy within 20 ft.; the target must save vs. Petrification or be stunned for 1 round.~

// Summon Draco-Hydra
@3 = ~Summon Draco-Hydra~
@4 = ~Summon Draco-Hydra
(Conjuration)

Level: 8
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 8
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

The Black Dragon Disciple calls forth the spirit of a draco-hydra, a many-headed beast of draconic blood, which fights at his side until the spell ends. Only one draco-hydra can answer the call at a time: the spell cannot be cast again until the current one runs out.

Draco-Hydra: 100 hit points, Armor Class 2, THAC0 8, 5 attacks per round (bites: 1d10+2, +3 weapon); immune to acid, fear and poison.
Acid Breath: every 3 rounds at most, the draco-hydra breathes a cone of acid at its enemies, 6d8 acid damage, save vs. Breath for half.~

// Summon Dragon Turtle
@5 = ~Summon Dragon Turtle~
@6 = ~Summon Dragon Turtle
(Conjuration)

Level: 9
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 turn + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 9
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

The Black Dragon Disciple calls forth the spirit of a black dragon turtle, a huge armoured beast of the swamps, which fights at his side until the spell ends. Only one dragon turtle can answer the call at a time: the spell cannot be cast again until the current one runs out.

Black Dragon Turtle: 130 hit points, Armor Class -2, THAC0 6, 2 attacks per round (bite: 4d6+4, +4 weapon); immune to acid, fear and poison.
Acid Steam: every 3 rounds at most, the dragon turtle breathes a wave of acid steam, 8d8 acid damage, save vs. Breath for half.~

// creatures
@7 = ~Dracolisk~
@8 = ~Draco-Hydra~
@9 = ~Black Dragon Turtle~
// abilities
@10 = ~Stunning Gaze~
@11 = ~Stunned by the dracolisk's gaze~
@12 = ~Acid Breath~
@13 = ~Acid Steam~
// weapons
@14 = ~Dracolisk Bite~
@15 = ~Draco-Hydra Bites~
@16 = ~Dragon Turtle Bite~
// one at a time
@17 = ~This creature already answers your call: wait until the spell runs out.~
